    "final_response_text": "The products most urgently at risk of stock-outs right now are:\n\n1. **Gorgonzola Telino**: 0 units in stock, reorder level is 20, stock difference is -20.\n2. **Louisiana Hot Spiced Okra**: 4 units in stock, reorder level is 20, stock difference is -16.\n3. **Mascarpone Fabioli**: 9 units in stock, reorder level is 25, stock difference is -16.\n4. **Outback Lager**: 15 units in stock, reorder level is 30, stock difference is -15.\n5. **Gravad lax**: 11 units in stock, reorder level is 25, stock difference is -14.\n\nThese products have stock levels below their reorder points and should be prioritized for restocking.",
